{"server":"en","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_05_end","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_05","title":"Crude Mounts","storyCode":"WR-5","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"7f537ea0ea48255e59b43400cfe1fe58321f7f42141e741bceb74045eb7cee31","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Villager","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"Stay away! Get back!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Villager","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"It—it bit off my hand—ha, haha—why can't I feel any pain at all, why—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ink Spirit","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"Gkhaa!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Villager","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"Eek—stay away!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you okay?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Villager","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"Why did you only just come?! Why did nobody sound the bell?! Where'd the vigilant monk go?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Villager","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"You know we trusted you, so we did what you said! Why! Why did my husband have to die?! How can you make up for that?! How?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"We'll talk when we're safe."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Little Girl","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"Waaahhh—mama, mama! Give my mama back!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ink Spirit","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"Gkhaa!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mr. Nothing","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"Whoa, there! Even less close for comfort!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Little Girl","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"M-Mister, mama, mama—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ink Spirit","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"Gkhaa!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mr. Nothing","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's ignore this fellow for now! There seems be something disastrous afoot outside! Young lady, hold on tight, we're going to slip out of here!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ink Spirit","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"Gkhaa—! Gkhaa!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mr. Nothing","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"Another one?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't—I can't deal with this!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ink Spirit","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"Gkhaa—!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ink Spirit","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"Gkh!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Where the hell did they all come from?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Damnit, there's no way I can hold back this many—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ink Spirit","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Gkh...?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saga","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"Though they may figures in a painting, there is no need to slaughter them all... observing such a scene only serves to inspire outbursts of sorrow."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saga","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"Lava, I am here to watch this place. Thou would best hurry to take others to refuge."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"You..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saga","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"Worry not for me. I have traveled many times here. I have had all manner of thought on the future, anxieties indeterminate—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saga","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"—but for that in front of me, I have never been one moment nor fraction irresolute."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saga","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"Leave this to me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Alright. Keep going east. When you're done, find me and we'll converge."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saga","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"Understood!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ink Spirit","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"Gkhaa!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saga","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"I am here! None shall come forward!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ink Spirit","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saga","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"Those who pass this line—shall be cut down."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Little Girl","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Waaahhh—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mr. Nothing","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ow, ow! My dear young lady! Might you be able to stop pulling on my hair!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Little Girl","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Mamaaa—mamaaaa—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ink Spirit","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Gkhaa!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mr. Nothing","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"These cretins only keep gkh-gkh-gkhing! How can things so bent on chasing you not spit out a human word or two?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ink Spirit","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Gkh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ink Spirit","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...DON'T... RUN..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mr. Nothing","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"Good heavens, I was only joking! You need not! You absolutely need not—!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Little Girl","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*whimper* Mister, l—look in front!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mr. Nothing","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"Eh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Villager","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"Yaaagh!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Villager","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"A—Are you that fortune-teller...? Where are the other two heroes?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Villager","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"Behind you, behind you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ink Spirit","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"Gkhaa!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Villager","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"Why did you bring it over here!? Think of something—think of something!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mr. Nothing","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"What can I possibly think of?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Villager","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"Lead them away from here, away!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mr. Nothing","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"I... I'm..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Little Girl","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"*whimper* Waaahhhh, mama, mama—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mr. Nothing","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Villager","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, just stop crying! Stop! Stop crying, girl!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Villager","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"Agh! Those things are looking at us! Get out of here, get out of—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ink Spirit","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"Gkhaaaaaagh!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Villager","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Villager","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"Y-You used your fan?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mr. Nothing","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"Hide yourselves further away."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ink Spirit","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"Gkhao? Gkhaa—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"]"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Villager","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"In one move...?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ink Spirit","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ao!?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Villager","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"A-Amazing..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mr. Nothing","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mr. Nothing","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"Ow-Owie, it hurts so much, it hurts so much—just what are these things, and how can they look so soft, yet be so hard when striking them?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mr. Nothing","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, stop goggling at me. The proverb puts it well; even a cornered burdenbeast will bite. Here, we'd best just hurry on our way!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ink Spirit","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"Gkhao..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mr. Nothing","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kroos","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"Man alive, Nothing, your kickboxing work's not bad, but you've never done a rescue business like this, eh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kroos","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"Deal with the enemies in front of you without checking movement on your whole perimeter, and sooner or later you'll give yourself grief."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mr. Nothing","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah, ahahah... that was quite dangerous just now! My apologies for the grief I gave you, benefactor. Only thanks to you am I safe and sound."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kroos","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"Alright, quick, go and get everyone left into shelter."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mr. Nothing","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"Er, what about you, benefactor?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kroos","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"Me? Don't you mind, I walk light as a feather. They won't ever notice me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mr. Nothing","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"(Can the single skill of light-footedness really explain that?!)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kroos","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"And then... how do we cut down these Ink Spirit numbers fast...?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Villager","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"Eyaah! Wh—what's that fire in the garden?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saga","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"Hoo! This blaze soaring skyward makes quite a spectacle!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saga","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"Ho? Could it be that the name 'Lava' held this exact meaning?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kroos","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"Lavaaa."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Confirm the extent of all enemy scatter in the vicinity for me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kroos","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"This big of an arena?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm worried about the surrounding buildings getting caught up, so I've been sort of keeping my Arts tied down..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"...but there's just too many enemies. If we keep dragging this out, I'm concerned casualties are going to end up tough to estimate."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kroos","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"Roger. Special times, special methods, right."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kroos","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll find a high vantage point. You focus on casting."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kroos","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll help you sort all the ones outside your Arts range. I guarantee I'm not gonna miss a single one."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Good."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll submit the mission report afterwards... after all, it's not just the Infected that Rhodes Island helps."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kroos","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"Infected...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"What's up?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kroos","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh... nothing, actually. By the way, Lava."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kroos","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"You seen Mr. Umbrella-Boiler anywhere?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["Lava"]},{"speakerId":"char_362_Saga","aliases":["Saga"]},{"speakerId":"char_455_nothing","aliases":["Ink Spirit","Mr. Nothing"]}]}
